<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-12T03:57:42.316Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:57:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to target civilians in Plateau State, killing three miners at an illegal mining site, injuring others, and raiding a community where they abducted five people and shot two. Fulani herders expressed anger over a crackdown in Plateau, while a priest was left unconscious after an attack in Benue State and a Nigerian immigrant severed a Malaysian police officer's wrist before being shot dead. Tensions flared in Kaduna as residents reported an attack on Muslims during a burial, which police dispute as a religious clash. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQMGJ0XzNpMHFGZE92em51c0syWmxld09tWGM0M1BNMThvMkxwSE1leGduMVF2eExmUzlRSXZBRmpCM0lYQVdVVERGZ2JPT2dQeUdhZXJkVXd3T1NhdTlrQ2hmZ0VDeGJBT1hENlhrTGVCSWxKSUJQaU85bzE1Y1RXUkhJMnRiYkxSR0NTODh6UHoyMEdmNU50VHJMUjdMamJwR05ZLV9iT2Jmd2VPVncyZkEzLVI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE9NN3pkaC1OX2FZSmlpN29QZ3hCNUJFeWFkd21ZUGxFM2Q5M1VjYnYxd2k1U243SDdFQzBZUXpCeVBPVE5VV1MxR080M3o1TzBvNTVfUkVjN0xTallWM2J5R2xzX0NjeUx5MGNZeXdOcmZnQjduYmtv?oc=5&quot;&gt;New National Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9EQlk4b3p3SHFJS0J1NDVtUG91X0dYeGNfSHBjek1MakNyMzlfUWk3WWp5TTltbmJJQ2Y3VjR1YkkwVHFVeW1vNzN2UkhXWE5CdGY5RTdrRnFLSEVQakpvaVlORG9odkRLcUFqYWhFWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl